egin="4.980" end="5.040">で</span></span></span><span begin="5.040" end="5.200">て</span><span begin="5.200" end="5.300">く</span><span begin="5.300" end="5.380">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">全都源源不断涌现出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dete kuru dete kuru</span></p><p begin="5.380" end="6.910" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">我</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5.380" end="5.620">われ</span></span></span><span begin="5.620" end="5.700">ら</span><span begin="5.700" end="5.800">が</span><span begin="5.800" end="5.900">イ</span><span begin="5.900" end="5.980">ン</span><span begin="5.980" end="6.180">ター</span><span begin="6.180" end="6.440">ネッ</span><span begin="6.440" end="6.590">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这就是我们的互联网</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">warera ga intānetto</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="6.600" end="6.910"><span begin="6.600" end="6.730">(ネッ</span><span begin="6.730" end="6.910">ツ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">网络</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nettsu</span></span></p><p begin="6.963" end="8.552" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">効</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.963" end="7.140">こう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">率</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.140" end="7.340">りつ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">重</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.340" end="7.543">じゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">視</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.543" end="7.840">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">讲究效率至上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kōritsu jūshi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="7.708" end="8.552"><span begin="7.708" end="7.828">(こ</span><span begin="7.828" end="7.953">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">肉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.953" end="8.163">にく</span></span></span><span begin="8.163" end="8.291">ジ</span><span begin="8.291" end="8.357">ュ</span><span begin="8.358" end="8.424">ー</span><span begin="8.424" end="8.488">シ</span><span begin="8.488" end="8.552">ー)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这肉鲜嫩多汁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono niku jūshī</span></span></p><p begin="8.520" end="10.050" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.520" end="8.660">ぬ</span></span></span><span begin="8.660" end="8.760">け</span><span begin="8.760" end="8.860">ちゃ</span><span begin="8.860" end="8.960">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乳</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.960" end="9.120">にゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.120" end="9.440">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">快要脱落的乳牙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nukechau nyūshi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="9.373" end="10.050"><span begin="9.373" end="9.477">(あ</span><span begin="9.477" end="9.580">い</span><span begin="9.580" end="9.693">た</span><span begin="9.693" end="9.789">た</span><span begin="9.789" end="9.940">た</span><span begin="9.940" end="10.050">ぁ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哎呀好痛好痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aitatatā</span></span></p><p begin="10.093" end="11.700" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">魔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.093" end="10.260">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.260" end="10.420">ほう</span></span></span><span begin="10.420" end="10.520">み</span><span begin="10.520" end="10.660">た</span><span begin="10.660" end="10.700">い</span><span begin="10.700" end="10.780">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.780" end="10.880">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">加</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.880" end="11.020">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">工</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.020" end="11.220">こう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.220" end="11.320">み</span></span></span><span begin="11.320" end="11.420">た</span><span begin="11.420" end="11.500">い</span><span begin="11.500" end="11.700">な?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">像魔法一样的无修原图 你也想看吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mahō mitai na mukakō mitai na?</span></p><p begin="11.700" end="13.040" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="11.700" end="12.080">きゃ・</span><span begin="12.080" end="12.480">わ・</span><span begin="12.480" end="13.040">いー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">太·可·爱·啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kya wa ī</span></p><p begin="13.220" end="16.060" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.220" end="13.680">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.680" end="14.060">きょう</span></span></span><span begin="14.060" end="14.280">あ</span><span begin="14.280" end="14.440">た</span><span begin="14.440" end="14.680">し</span><span begin="14.680" end="14.880">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">番</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.880" end="16.060">ばーん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轮到最强的我登场</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saikyō atashi no bān</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="14.880" end="16.060"><span begin="14.880" end="15.410">(ばー</span><span begin="15.410" end="16.060">ん)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">砰——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bān</span></span></p><p begin="16.400" end="19.030" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="16.400" end="16.660">や</span><span begin="16.660" end="16.800">り</span><span begin="16.800" end="17.040">す</span><span begin="17.040" end="17.220">ぎ</span><span begin="17.220" end="17.633">ちゃっ</span><span begin="17.633" end="17.840">た</span><span begin="17.840" end="18.033">ら</span><span begin="18.033" end="18.823">ban?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">玩得太过火就会被封禁？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yarisugichattara ban?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="18.040" end="19.030"><span begin="18.040" end="18.410">(ばー</span><span begin="18.410" end="19.030">ん)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">砰——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bān</span></span></p><p begin="19.340" end="22.320" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="19.340" end="20.020">チー</span><span begin="20.020" end="20.160">ト</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">級?</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.160" end="20.580">きゅう</span></span></span><span begin="20.580" end="20.800">で</span><span begin="20.800" end="20.960">も</span><span begin="20.960" end="21.380">こ</span><span begin="21.380" end="21.580">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.580" end="21.960">げん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.960" end="22.320">じつ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如同开挂一般？但这可是现实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chīto kyū? demo kore genjitsu</span></p><p begin="22.733" end="23.340" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="22.733" end="22.963">もっ</span><span begin="22.963" end="23.073">と</span><span begin="23.073" end="23.180">ちゃ</span><span begin="23.180" end="23.260">ん</span><span begin="23.260" end="23.340">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">再认真一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">motto chanto</span></p><p begin="23.340" end="24.760" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.340" end="23.560">あい</span></span></span><span begin="23.560" end="23.660">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">持っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.660" end="23.860">もっ</span></span></span><span begin="23.860" end="23.980">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">接</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.980" end="24.100">せっ</span></span></span><span begin="24.100" end="24.240">し</span><span begin="24.240" end="24.320">ま</span><span begin="24.320" end="24.540">しょ</span><span begin="24.540" end="24.760">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带着爱意来对待我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ai o motte sesshimashō</span></p><p begin="25.100" end="28.040" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="25.100" end="25.900">きー</span><span begin="25.900" end="26.213">り</span><span begin="26.213" end="26.490">つ</span> <span begin="26.680" end="26.940">れ</span><span begin="26.940" end="27.100">い</span> <span begin="27.460" end="27.620">ちゃ</span><span begin="27.620" end="27.680">く</span><span begin="27.680" end="27.800">せ</span><span begin="27.800" end="28.040">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">起——立 敬礼 请坐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kīritsu rei chakuseki</span></p><p begin="41.680" end="44.420" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="41.680" end="41.913">あ</span><span begin="41.913" end="42.023">た</span><span begin="42.023" end="42.493">し</span><span begin="42.493" end="42.700">よ</span><span begin="42.700" end="42.860">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">下</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.860" end="43.460">した</span></span></span><span begin="43.460" end="43.700">い</span><span begin="43.700" end="43.900">な</span><span begin="43.900" end="44.060">い</span><span begin="44.060" end="44.420">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">毕竟没有人比我更不起眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">atashi yori shita inai shi</span></p><p begin="44.840" end="47.580" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.840" end="45.280">えい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">響</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.280" end="45.680">きょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">力</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.680" end="46.200">りょく</span></span></span><span begin="46.200" end="46.620">ゼ</span><span begin="46.620" end="46.840">ロ</span><span begin="46.840" end="47.140">だ</span><span begin="47.140" end="47.580">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">影响力也完全是零</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">eikyōryoku zero da shi</span></p><p begin="47.933" end="50.780" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.933" end="48.220">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.220" end="48.570">かい</span></span></span><span begin="48.570" end="48.740">は</span><span begin="48.740" end="49.020">そ</span><span begin="49.020" end="49.200">れ</span><span begin="49.200" end="49.380">で</span><span begin="49.380" end="49.780">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">回っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.780" end="50.360">まわっ</span></span></span><span begin="50.360" end="50.620">ちゃ</span><span begin="50.620" end="50.780">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">世界却依然自顾自地运转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sekai wa soredemo mawacchau</span></p><p begin="51.160" end="53.860" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.160" end="51.400">か</span></span></span><span begin="51.400" end="51.580">わ</span><span begin="51.580" end="51.780">れ</span><span begin="51.780" end="51.980">た</span><span begin="51.980" end="52.140">の</span><span begin="52.140" end="52.360">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.360" end="52.960">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="52.960" end="53.150">の</span><span begin="53.150" end="53.340">お</span><span begin="53.340" end="53.560">か</span><span begin="53.560" end="53.860">げ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">能够迎来改变 全都多亏了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawareta no wa kimi no okage</span></p><p begin="53.940" end="55.933" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="53.940" end="54.313">Yo</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.313" end="54.540">きん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">急</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.540" end="54.740">きゅう</span></span></span><span begin="54.740" end="54.840">ク</span><span begin="54.840" end="54.960">エ</span><span begin="54.960" end="55.060">ス</span><span begin="55.060" end="55.240">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">Yo 突发紧急任务</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yo kinkyū kuesuto</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="55.513" end="55.933"><span begin="55.513" end="55.933">(え～)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">诶～</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ē</span></span></p><p begin="55.933" end="57.450" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="55.933" end="56.120">ボッ</span><span begin="56.120" end="56.220">チ</span><span begin="56.220" end="56.320">じゃ</span><span begin="56.320" end="56.400">ク</span><span begin="56.400" end="56.520">エ</span><span begin="56.520" end="56.623">ス</span><span begin="56.623" end="56.790">チョ</span><span begin="56.790" end="56.900">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">孤身一人就满头问号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bocchi ja kuesuchon</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="56.900" end="57.450"><span begin="56.900" end="56.970">(ク</span><span begin="56.970" end="57.043">エ</span><span begin="57.043" end="57.153">ス</span><span begin="57.153" end="57.320">チョ</span><span begin="57.320" end="57.450">ン)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">满头问号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuesuchon</span></span></p><p begin="57.493" end="59.040" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="57.493" end="57.620">や</span><span begin="57.620" end="57.700">り</span><span begin="57.700" end="57.800">た</span><span begin="57.800" end="57.880">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">放</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.880" end="58.080">ほう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">題</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.080" end="58.260">だい</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.260" end="58.380">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.380" end="58.600">ちが</span></span></span><span begin="58.600" end="58.680">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.680" end="58.883">こう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.883" end="59.040">かい</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">肆意妄为 犯错又后悔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yaritai hōdai machigai kōkai</span></p><p begin="59.040" end="1:00.510" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">我</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.040" end="59.300">われ</span></span></span><span begin="59.300" end="59.400">ら</span><span begin="59.400" end="59.480">が</span><span begin="59.480" end="59.560">イ</span><span begin="59.560" end="59.680">ン</span><span begin="59.680" end="59.873">ター</span><span begin="59.873" end="1:00.030">ネッ</span><span begin="1:00.030" end="1:00.140">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这就是我们的互联网</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">warera ga intānetto</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:00.223" end="1:00.510"><span begin="1:00.223" end="1:00.350">(ネッ</span><span begin="1:00.350" end="1:00.510">ツ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">网络</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nettsu</span></span></p><p begin="1:00.663" end="1:02.200" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">天</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.663" end="1:00.860">てん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.860" end="1:01.100">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">爛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.100" end="1:01.300">らん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">漫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.300" end="1:01.460">まん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">天真烂漫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tenshin ranman</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:01.460" end="1:02.200"><span begin="1:01.460" end="1:01.540">(ペ</span><span begin="1:01.540" end="1:01.680">ン</span><span begin="1:01.680" end="1:01.740">ギ</span><span begin="1:01.740" end="1:01.840">ン</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">短</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.840" end="1:02.010">たん</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.010" end="1:02.130">パ</span><span begin="1:02.130" end="1:02.200">ン?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">企鹅穿短裤？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pengin tanpan?</span></span></p><p begin="1:02.200" end="1:03.780" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:02.200" end="1:02.340">可</span><span begin="1:02.340" end="1:02.500">愛</span><span begin="1:02.500" end="1:02.650">さ</span><span begin="1:02.650" end="1:02.750">ワ</span><span begin="1:02.750" end="1:02.880">ン</span><span begin="1:02.880" end="1:02.940">パ</span><span begin="1:02.940" end="1:03.023">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">可爱度一击必杀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawaisa wanpan</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:03.023" end="1:03.780"><span begin="1:03.023" end="1:03.140">(あ</span><span begin="1:03.140" end="1:03.220">い</span><span begin="1:03.220" end="1:03.320">た</span><span begin="1:03.320" end="1:03.420">た</span><span begin="1:03.420" end="1:03.780">たぁ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哎呀好痛好痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aitatatā</span></span></p><p begin="1:03.783" end="1:05.340" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">盛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.783" end="1:03.900">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:03.900" end="1:04.020">れ</span><span begin="1:04.020" end="1:04.120">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:04.120" end="1:04.200">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.200" end="1:04.420">がん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.420" end="1:04.620">めん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">溶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.620" end="1:04.680">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:04.680" end="1:04.800">け</span><span begin="1:04.800" end="1:04.920">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:04.920" end="1:05.000">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">晩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.000" end="1:05.200">ばん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">年</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.200" end="1:05.340">ねん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">拍得超美的颜值 融化殆尽的晚年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">morechau ganmen tokechau bannnen</span></p><p begin="1:05.340" end="1:06.940" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.340" end="1:05.660">しあわ</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.660" end="1:05.780">せ</span><span begin="1:05.780" end="1:06.000">ハッ</span><span begin="1:06.000" end="1:06.180">ピー</span><span begin="1:06.180" end="1:06.360">で</span><span begin="1:06.360" end="1:06.540">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真是幸福又快乐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shiawase happī desu</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:06.540" end="1:06.940"><span begin="1:06.540" end="1:06.740">(いぇ</span><span begin="1:06.740" end="1:06.940">い)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">耶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yei</span></span></p><p begin="1:06.940" end="1:08.560" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.940" end="1:07.200">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">短</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.200" end="1:07.360">たん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">距</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.360" end="1:07.460">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">離</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.460" end="1:07.660">り</span></span></span> <span begin="1:07.660" end="1:07.790">ジャ</span><span begin="1:07.790" end="1:07.940">イ</span><span begin="1:07.940" end="1:08.010">ア</span><span begin="1:08.010" end="1:08.080">ン</span><span begin="1:08.080" end="1:08.140">ト</span><span begin="1:08.140" end="1:08.280">キ</span><span begin="1:08.280" end="1:08.380">リ</span><span begin="1:08.380" end="1:08.420">ン</span><span begin="1:08.420" end="1:08.483">グ</span><span begin="1:08.483" end="1:08.560">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">以最短距离 上演以下克上的逆袭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saitan kyori jaianto kiringu de</span></p><p begin="1:08.560" end="1:09.700" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="1:08.560" end="1:08.760">レ</span><span begin="1:08.760" end="1:08.940">ベ</span><span begin="1:08.940" end="1:09.080">ル</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.080" end="1:09.360">あ</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.360" end="1:09.700">げ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一路升级</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">reberu age</span></p><p begin="1:09.740" end="1:10.820" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="1:09.740" end="1:09.880">あー</span><span begin="1:09.880" end="1:10.133">ん</span><span begin="1:10.133" end="1:10.240">バ</span><span begin="1:10.240" end="1:10.320">グ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">技</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.320" end="1:10.520">わざ</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.520" end="1:10.740">ゲッ</span><span begin="1:10.740" end="1:10.820">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">啊嗯 解锁漏洞秘技</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ān bagu waza getto</span></p><p begin="1:10.820" end="1:12.340" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="1:10.820" end="1:11.040">きゅ</span><span begin="1:11.040" end="1:11.120">る</span><span begin="1:11.120" end="1:11.240">る</span><span begin="1:11.240" end="1:11.300">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.300" end="1:11.500">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.500" end="1:11.700">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">級</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.700" end="1:12.340">きゅう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">闪亮灵动地越级跃升</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyururun tobikyū</span></p><p begin="1:13.240" end="1:13.960" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.240" end="1:13.400">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">自</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.400" end="1:13.480">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.480" end="1:13.680">かく</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.680" end="1:13.800">な</span><span begin="1:13.800" end="1:13.960">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这一切都毫无自觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mujikaku nano</span></p><p begin="1:13.960" end="1:16.040" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">天</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.960" end="1:14.280">てん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">然</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.280" end="1:14.480">ねん</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.480" end="1:14.600">な</span><span begin="1:14.600" end="1:14.760">のっ</span><span begin="1:14.760" end="1:14.840">て</span><span begin="1:14.840" end="1:15.040">そ</span><span begin="1:15.040" end="1:15.263">れ</span><span begin="1:15.263" end="1:15.360">メ</span><span begin="1:15.360" end="1:15.660">ロ</span><span begin="1:15.660" end="1:16.040">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份天然呆实在太让人心动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tennen nano tte sore meroi</span></p><p begin="1:16.040" end="1:17.220" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:16.040" end="1:16.200">あー</span><span begin="1:16.200" end="1:16.400">ん</span><span begin="1:16.400" end="1:16.640">もっ</span><span begin="1:16.640" end="1:16.840">と</span><span begin="1:16.840" end="1:17.020">もっ</span><span begin="1:17.020" end="1:17.220">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">啊嗯 还要更多更多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ān motto motto</span></p><p begin="1:17.220" end="1:18.480" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:17.220" end="1:17.343">あ</span><span begin="1:17.343" end="1:17.433">ざ</span><span begin="1:17.433" end="1:17.533">と</span><span begin="1:17.533" end="1:17.633">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">急</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.633" end="1:17.760">きゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.760" end="1:17.900">じょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">昇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.900" end="1:18.480">しょう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带着满满小心机急速飙升</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">azatoku kyūjōshō</span></p><p begin="1:18.800" end="1:19.500" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:18.800" end="1:19.020">い</span><span begin="1:19.020" end="1:19.200">く</span><span begin="1:19.200" end="1:19.500">よ</span>