>(きゃー)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">呀——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyā</span></span></p><p begin="2:03.813" end="2:05.280" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.813" end="2:03.900">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">課</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.900" end="2:04.020">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">金</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.020" end="2:04.180">きん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.180" end="2:04.320">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.320" end="2:04.480">りっ</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.480" end="2:04.780">しょ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不氪金根本做不到吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mukakin murissho?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:04.780" end="2:05.280"><span begin="2:04.780" end="2:04.840">(む</span><span begin="2:04.840" end="2:04.953">りっ</span><span begin="2:04.953" end="2:05.280">しょ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">做不到吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">murissho</span></span></p><p begin="2:05.360" end="2:06.980" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:05.360" end="2:05.500">な</span><span begin="2:05.500" end="2:05.580">り</span><span begin="2:05.580" end="2:05.720">た</span><span begin="2:05.720" end="2:05.780">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">将</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.780" end="2:05.980">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.980" end="2:06.253">らい</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">場</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.253" end="2:06.330">ば</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.330" end="2:06.480">ちが</span></span></span><span begin="2:06.480" end="2:06.560">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.560" end="2:06.760">げん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">在</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.760" end="2:06.980">ざい</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">憧憬的未来 格格不入的现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">naritai shōrai bachigai genzai</span></p><p begin="2:06.980" end="2:08.540" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">我</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.980" end="2:07.180">われ</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.180" end="2:07.280">ら</span><span begin="2:07.280" end="2:07.400">が</span><span begin="2:07.400" end="2:07.470">イ</span><span begin="2:07.470" end="2:07.540">ン</span><span begin="2:07.540" end="2:07.763">ター</span><span begin="2:07.763" end="2:08.003">ネッ</span><span begin="2:08.003" end="2:08.150">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这就是我们的互联网</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">warera ga intānetto</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:08.000" end="2:08.540"><span begin="2:08.000" end="2:08.400">(ネッ</span><span begin="2:08.400" end="2:08.540">ツ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">网络</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nettsu</span></span></p><p begin="2:08.550" end="2:10.133" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">電</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.550" end="2:08.760">でん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.760" end="2:08.940">こう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">石</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.940" end="2:09.140">せっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">火</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.140" end="2:09.340">か</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">电光石火之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">denkō sekka</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:09.340" end="2:10.133">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.340" end="2:09.553">がん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.553" end="2:09.743">めん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">劣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.743" end="2:09.933">れっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">化↓</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.933" end="2:10.133">か</span></span></span>)<span ttm:role="x-translation">颜值下滑↓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ganmen rekka</span></span></p><p begin="2:10.133" end="2:11.663" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="2:10.133" end="2:10.323">ピー</span><span begin="2:10.323" end="2:10.420">ク</span><span begin="2:10.420" end="2:10.520">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.520" end="2:10.640">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">瞬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.640" end="2:10.960">しゅん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">巅峰只有一瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pīku wa isshun</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:10.920" end="2:11.663"><span begin="2:10.920" end="2:11.000">(や</span><span begin="2:11.000" end="2:11.120">め</span><span begin="2:11.120" end="2:11.220">た</span><span begin="2:11.220" end="2:11.390">げ</span><span begin="2:11.390" end="2:11.663">てぇ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">快别这么说啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yametagetē</span></span></p><p begin="2:11.663" end="2:13.280" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">盛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.663" end="2:11.820">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:11.820" end="2:11.920">れ</span><span begin="2:11.920" end="2:12.020">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:12.020" end="2:12.100">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.100" end="2:12.340">がん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.340" end="2:12.500">めん</span></span></span> <span begin="2:12.500" end="2:12.600">ロ</span><span begin="2:12.600" end="2:12.720">ベ</span><span begin="2:12.720" end="2:12.800">カ</span><span begin="2:12.800" end="2:12.900">ル</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">晩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.900" end="2:13.120">ばん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">年</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.120" end="2:13.280">ねん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">拍得超美的颜值 哪怕步入卡洛斯般的晚年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">morechau ganmen robekaru bannnen</span></p><p begin="2:13.280" end="2:14.740" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:13.280" end="2:13.460">パ</span><span begin="2:13.460" end="2:13.560">ワー</span><span begin="2:13.560" end="2:13.700">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">健</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.700" end="2:13.920">けん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">在</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.920" end="2:14.080">ざい</span></span></span><span begin="2:14.080" end="2:14.240">で</span><span begin="2:14.240" end="2:14.453">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">威力也依然不减当年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pawā wa kenzai desu</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:14.453" end="2:14.740"><span begin="2:14.453" end="2:14.660">(いぇ</span><span begin="2:14.660" end="2:14.740">い)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">耶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yei</span></span></p><p begin="2:14.763" end="2:17.640" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.763" end="2:15.080">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.080" end="2:15.260">あい</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.260" end="2:15.360">バ</span><span begin="2:15.360" end="2:15.560">ブ</span> <span begin="2:15.560" end="2:15.740">ア</span><span begin="2:15.740" end="2:15.863">イ</span><span begin="2:15.863" end="2:15.950">ド</span><span begin="2:15.950" end="2:16.053">ル</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">枠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.053" end="2:16.440">わく</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">目</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.440" end="2:16.640">め</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.640" end="2:16.770">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">合っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.770" end="2:17.220">あっ</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.220" end="2:17.640">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最爱的甜心宝贝 偶像席位上视线交汇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saiai babu aidoru waku me ga atte</span></p><p begin="2:17.640" end="2:20.400" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:17.640" end="2:17.820">あー</span><span begin="2:17.820" end="2:17.950">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">右</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.950" end="2:18.220">みぎ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">肩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.220" end="2:18.420">かた</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鋭</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.420" end="2:18.600">するど</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.600" end="2:18.700">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">角</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.700" end="2:18.980">かど</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.980" end="2:19.180">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">成</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.180" end="2:19.420">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">長</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.420" end="2:19.620">ちょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.620" end="2:20.400">つう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">啊嗯 右肩折线陡峭昂扬 伴随着成长痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ān migikata surudo na kado de seichōtsū</span></p><p begin="2:21.120" end="2:21.860" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.120" end="2:21.280">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.280" end="2:21.380">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">識</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.380" end="2:21.580">しき</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.580" end="2:21.700">な</span><span begin="2:21.700" end="2:21.860">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这一切都出于无意识</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">muishiki nano</span></p><p begin="2:21.860" end="2:23.920" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.860" end="2:22.180">あい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嬌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.180" end="2:22.360">きょう</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.360" end="2:22.480">な</span><span begin="2:22.480" end="2:22.640">のっ</span><span begin="2:22.640" end="2:22.760">て</span><span begin="2:22.760" end="2:22.960">ま</span><span begin="2:22.960" end="2:23.120">じ</span><span begin="2:23.120" end="2:23.300">ラ</span><span begin="2:23.300" end="2:23.500">ブ</span><span begin="2:23.500" end="2:23.920">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份讨喜娇俏真是惹人怜爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aikyō nano tte maji rabui</span></p><p begin="2:23.920" end="2:25.120" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span begin="2:23.920" end="2:24.070">あー</span><span begin="2:24.070" end="2:24.260">ん</span><span begin="2:24.260" end="2:24.520">もっ</span><span begin="2:24.520" end="2:24.740">と</span><span begin="2:24.740" end="2:24.920">もっ</span><span begin="2:24.920" end="2:25.120">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">啊嗯 还要更多更多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ān motto motto</span></p><p begin="2:25.120" end="2:27.400" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.120" end="2:25.240">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.240" end="2:25.320">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.320" end="2:25.500">ごと</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.500" end="2:25.640">し</span><span begin="2:25.640" end="2:25.700">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:25.700" end="2:25.820">い</span><span begin="2:25.820" end="2:25.920">ま</span><span begin="2:25.920" end="2:26.520">しょ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">快来为我尽情应援吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oshigoto shichaimasho?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:26.660" end="2:27.400"><span begin="2:26.660" end="2:27.240">(はー</span><span begin="2:27.240" end="2:27.400">い)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">好——的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hāi</span></span></p><p begin="2:40.020" end="2:42.460" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:40.020" end="2:40.240">セ</span><span begin="2:40.240" end="2:40.520">ン</span><span begin="2:40.520" end="2:40.893">ター</span><span begin="2:40.893" end="2:41.080">あ</span><span begin="2:41.080" end="2:41.280">た</span><span begin="2:41.280" end="2:41.520">し</span><span begin="2:41.520" end="2:41.720">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">番?</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.720" end="2:42.460">ばん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">中心位轮到我登场？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sentā atashi no ban?</span></p><p begin="2:43.260" end="2:45.800" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.260" end="2:43.700">ゆめ</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.700" end="2:44.083">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.083" end="2:44.473">なか</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.473" end="2:44.680">か</span><span begin="2:44.680" end="2:44.820">ら</span><span begin="2:44.820" end="2:45.800">ban</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">从梦境之中被驱逐出局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yume no naka kara ban</span></p><p begin="2:46.200" end="2:49.220" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.200" end="2:46.600">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">会っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.600" end="2:46.980">あっ</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.980" end="2:47.240">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:47.240" end="2:47.400">う</span> <span begin="2:47.400" end="2:47.620">そ</span><span begin="2:47.620" end="2:47.800">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">超</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.800" end="2:48.400">ちょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">展</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.400" end="2:48.820">てん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">開</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.820" end="2:49.220">かい</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">与你相遇 就是超乎想象的神展开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">deacchau sore chō tenkai</span></p><p begin="2:49.360" end="2:51.920" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.360" end="2:49.820">あい</span></span></span><span begin="2:49.820" end="2:50.020">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">持っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.020" end="2:50.200">もっ</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.200" end="2:50.360">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">接</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.360" end="2:50.700">せっ</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.700" end="2:51.000">し</span><span begin="2:51.000" end="2:51.120">ま</span><span begin=