an ttm:role="x-translation">这一切都毫无自觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mujikaku nano</span></p><p begin="2:59.740" end="3:01.820" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">天</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.740" end="3:00.080">てん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">然</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.080" end="3:00.260">ねん</span></span></span><span begin="3:00.260" end="3:00.380">な</span><span begin="3:00.380" end="3:00.540">のっ</span><span begin="3:00.540" end="3:00.660">て</span><span begin="3:00.660" end="3:00.840">そ</span><span begin="3:00.840" end="3:01.100">れ</span><span begin="3:01.100" end="3:01.200">メ</span><span begin="3:01.200" end="3:01.440">ロ</span><span begin="3:01.440" end="3:01.820">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份天然呆实在太让人心动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tennen nano tte sore meroi</span></p><p begin="3:01.820" end="3:03.020" itunes:key="L72" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="3:01.820" end="3:02.040">あー</span><span begin="3:02.040" end="3:02.243">ん</span><span begin="3:02.243" end="3:02.433">もっ</span><span begin="3:02.433" end="3:02.640">と</span><span begin="3:02.640" end="3:02.820">もっ</span><span begin="3:02.820" end="3:03.020">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">啊嗯 还要更多更多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ān motto motto</span></p><p begin="3:03.020" end="3:04.300" itunes:key="L73" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="3:03.020" end="3:03.180">あ</span><span begin="3:03.180" end="3:03.260">ざ</span><span begin="3:03.260" end="3:03.320">と</span><span begin="3:03.320" end="3:03.420">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">急</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.420" end="3:03.620">きゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.620" end="3:03.780">じょう</span></span></spa